;;; Item 60, the blind enumerator writes: one person, one food, four relations, and no rule that proposes, so
;;; the blind enumerator guesses a fact of every relation over every name. The page of Q-M1f.578 ran it as
;;; 1-blind-no-list.ein.

(relation person T   :why "{?3} is a person")
(relation food   T   :why "{?3} is a food")
(relation likes  T T :why "{?3} likes {?4}")
(relation knows  T T :why "{?3} knows {?4}")

(person Ann)
(food Soup)
